@startuml ConsistentListFromCache Sequence Diagram

title ConsistentListFromCache Flow During Namespace Deletion

actor "Namespace Controller" as NC
participant "API Server" as API
participant "CacheDelegator" as CD
participant "Watch Cache" as WC
participant "etcd" as ETCD
participant "Namespace Deleter" as ND

== Namespace Deletion Initiated ==

NC -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns
API -> ND: Delete namespace resources

== Resource Discovery Phase ==

ND -> API: GET /api (discovery)
API -> CD: GetList(key="", opts={ResourceVersion=""})

note over CD: ConsistentRead=true because RV=""

CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
ETCD --> CD: currentRV=12345

note over CD: Set opts.ResourceVersion="12345"

CD -> WC: notFresh(12345)?
WC --> CD: true (cache RV=12340)

note over CD: Cache is behind, need to wait

CD -> ETCD: RequestWatchProgress()
ETCD --> WC: Progress notification
WC -> WC: Update resourceVersion=12345

CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(RV=12345)
WC --> CD: Resource list from cache

CD --> API: Discovery response
API --> ND: Available resource types

== Secret Deletion Storm Begins ==

loop For each resource type (secrets, configmaps, etc.)
    
    ND -> API: LIST /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets
    API -> CD: GetList(key="/secrets", opts={ResourceVersion=""})
    
    note over CD: Another ConsistentRead=true
    
    CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
    ETCD --> CD: currentRV=12346
    
    CD -> WC: notFresh(12346)?
    WC --> CD: true (cache RV=12345)
    
    CD -> ETCD: RequestWatchProgress()
    ETCD --> WC: Progress notification
    WC -> WC: Update resourceVersion=12346
    
    CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList(RV=12346)
    WC --> CD: Secret list (198K+ cache fetches)
    
    CD --> API: Secret list response
    API --> ND: Secrets to delete
    
    == Parallel Secret Deletions ==
    
    par
        ND -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets/secret-1
        API -> ETCD: Delete secret-1
        ETCD --> WC: Watch event (DELETE secret-1)
        WC -> WC: Invalidate cache entry
    also
        ND -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets/secret-2
        API -> ETCD: Delete secret-2
        ETCD --> WC: Watch event (DELETE secret-2)
        WC -> WC: Invalidate cache entry
    also
        ND -> API: DELETE /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets/secret-N
        API -> ETCD: Delete secret-N
        ETCD --> WC: Watch event (DELETE secret-N)
        WC -> WC: Invalidate cache entry
    end
    
    note over WC: Cache thrashing due to\nrapid invalidations
    
end

== Cache Consistency Failures ==

ND -> API: LIST /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/secrets (verification)
API -> CD: GetList(key="/secrets", opts={ResourceVersion=""})

CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
ETCD --> CD: currentRV=12500

CD -> WC: notFresh(12500)?
WC --> CD: true (cache RV=12480)

CD -> ETCD: RequestWatchProgress()
note over CD: Timeout waiting for cache\nto catch up (TooLargeResourceVersion)

CD -> CD: fallback=true
CD -> ETCD: GetList(key="/secrets", opts={ResourceVersion=""})
ETCD --> CD: Direct etcd query result

note over CD: IOPS spike due to fallback

CD --> API: Secret list (from etcd)
API --> ND: Remaining secrets

== Metrics Impact ==

note over CD: Metrics recorded:\n- apiserver_cache_list_fetched_objects_total{secrets}=198931\n- ConsistentReadTotal{fallback=true}++\n- etcd IOPS spike

== Other Resource Types ==

loop For configmaps, services, pods, etc.
    note over ND: Similar pattern repeats\nfor each resource type
    
    ND -> API: LIST /api/v1/namespaces/test-ns/{resource}
    API -> CD: GetList with ConsistentRead=true
    
    alt Cache is fresh
        CD -> WC: Serve from cache
        WC --> CD: Cached data
    else Cache is stale
        CD -> ETCD: GetCurrentResourceVersion()
        CD -> ETCD: RequestWatchProgress()
        alt Cache catches up
            CD -> WC: WaitUntilFreshAndList()
            WC --> CD: Fresh cached data
        else Timeout/Error
            CD -> ETCD: Fallback direct query
            ETCD --> CD: Direct etcd data
            note over CD: Additional IOPS load
        end
    end
    
    CD --> API: Resource list
    API --> ND: Resources to delete
end

== Final Cleanup ==

ND -> API: Remove finalizer from namespace
API -> ETCD: Update namespace (remove finalizer)
ETCD --> WC: Watch event (namespace updated)

NC -> API: DELETE namespace (final)
API -> ETCD: Delete namespace object
ETCD --> WC: Watch event (namespace deleted)

note over API: Namespace deletion complete\nTotal IOPS impact:\n- Base deletion operations\n- ConsistentRead RV queries\n- Watch progress requests\n- Fallback queries\n- Cache invalidation overhead

@enduml 